{
 "_comment": [
  "Lane-private pins for the multi-turn views sikl4s<k> (k in 1..3) of target qwen35_4b: per fit seed k, the six",
  "SI-distilled refits (KL distillation of a system-instruction-prompted teacher, fit on and served on the instruct",
  "checkpoint, every adapter acting at all token positions) of the safety SI (safety_refusal), the constitution SI",
  "(si_constitution) and the short irrelevant control SI (C16), each as the rank-4 o_proj LoRA (lora_r4, kind lora_all)",
  "and the all-layer ReLU steer (psr_kl_all, kind psr).",
  "",
  "WHY A PRIVATE FILE rather than entries in configs/sdfbase_full22_pins.json: these are comparison objects, not",
  "published objects, and nothing here is appended to any shared surface. The roster that consumes these pins is",
  "configs/sdfbase_full22_roster_sikl4.yaml, selected by the F22_ROSTER override, through the cross-bank pin form",
  "{pins, pin} (make_bank_view.plan_pin_entry, mt_serving_up._pin_form_sha, jobplan.object_id_for with pins_root).",
  "The file holds these eighteen objects and nothing else.",
  "",
  "KEYED BY SEED: the staged ids carry sikl4s<k>__ because the CELL id is the production spelling <SI>__<arm> (the",
  "fit seed lives in the view and the staged object, never in the cell id); view sikl4s<k> serves fit seed k.",
  "",
  "`source` is spelled RELATIVE to exp/objects and `bank` is its first component (make_bank_view.objects_root_of /",
  "plan_pin_entry). The builder resolves the staged copy at <objects root>/sikl4/qwen35_4b/cells/<staged_id> and",
  "requires this `source` view path to exist and resolve to that same directory. Each staged copy holds object.pt,",
  "its one identity sidecar and staged_from.json, copied from the fit's own cell",
  "(sikl4/qwen35_4b/fits/s<k>/<cell>/<cell>); no epoch checkpoint and no dose copy is staged.",
  "",
  "served_layer: the LoRA (lora_all) stores the 8 layers [3, 7, 11, 15, 19, 23, 27, 31] (site o_proj_out, served ==",
  "stored), so 3 is the first served block; the ReLU steer (psr) stores all 32 layers, so 0. The builder holds the",
  "value by membership in the blob's served layers.",
  "",
  "identity_sidecar: train_budget_meta.json, the trainer's fit record, which names the cell, the fit seed and the sha.",
  "",
  "Each sha is the sha256 of the fit's object.pt, re-hashed on the cluster and held equal to its",
  "train_budget_meta.json, its COMPLETE record and the registry object id filed for the fit (campaign",
  "si_target_refit). No sha here equals any entry of another configs/*pins*.json."
 ],
